OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen Rikki Stein first heard Fela
OL,7,     FKuti's music he was in the back of
OL,8,     Fa car and felt awestruck. Just a
OL,9,     Ffew years later Rikki was managing
OL,10,     FFela and the pair had become close
OL,11,     Ffriends.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1997, scientists set out to
OL,14,     Ffind a cave in Tsavo, Kenya,
OL,15,     Fbelieved to have once been the den
OL,16,     Fof the man-eating lions that
OL,17,     Fterrorised Indian and African
OL,18,     Frailway workers in 1898.
